// Original graded reading. Product names, policies and messages are practice scenarios.
U('folder-permission',0,'允许访问，不等于允许修改','权限提示',[
 ['This application would like to access your Downloads folder. You can allow access to the whole folder or select individual files instead. If you choose individual files, the application will only be able to read the files you select. You can change this choice later in Settings.','这个应用希望访问你的“下载”文件夹。你可以允许访问整个文件夹，也可以改为选择单个文件。如果选择单个文件，应用只能读取你选中的文件。之后可以在设置中更改这个选择。'],
 ['Access to the folder does not give the application permission to change its contents. To save an edited file in the same location, you will need to grant write permission separately. If you are not sure why the application needs access, cancel this request and check its help page before continuing.','允许访问文件夹并不意味着允许应用修改其中的内容。要将编辑后的文件保存在同一位置，你需要另外授予写入权限。如果不清楚应用为什么需要访问，请取消请求，查看帮助页面后再继续。']
],[['access','访问','The app needs access to this folder.'],['individual files','单个文件','Select individual files instead.'],['be able to','能够','It will be able to read selected files.'],['grant permission','授予权限','Grant write permission separately.'],['before continuing','在继续之前','Check the help page before continuing.']],[[
 '选择单个文件后，应用可以读取什么？',['所有磁盘','你选中的文件','整个下载文件夹'],1,'only 限定范围：the files you select。'],['读取权限是否自动包含修改权限？',['是','只在晚上包含','不包含，写入需要另外授权'],2,'第二段明确区分 access 和 write permission。'],['不知道用途时，文章建议什么？',['先取消并查看帮助','允许所有权限','删除文件夹'],0,'建议是 cancel this request and check its help page。']
],{task:'向朋友解释，你为什么只允许一个应用读取选中的文件。',audience:'刚安装应用的朋友',length:'4～6 句',requirements:['说明允许访问的范围','区分读取与修改权限','说明不清楚用途时应该先查帮助'],starter:'I selected…\nThis allows the app to…',model:'I selected individual files instead of allowing access to the whole folder. The app can only read the files I choose. Reading a file does not give it permission to change the file. Write permission must be granted separately. If you are unsure why the app needs access, check its help page first.'});
U('postpone-update',0,'稍后更新究竟会发生什么','更新提示',[
 ['An update is ready to install. Installing it will close the application, so please save any open documents first. You can install now or choose Remind me tomorrow. Choosing the reminder will leave your current version running. It will not cancel the downloaded update or remove your documents.','更新已准备好安装。安装会关闭应用，因此请先保存打开的文档。你可以现在安装，或选择“明天提醒我”。选择提醒会继续运行当前版本，不会取消已下载的更新，也不会删除文档。'],
 ['If you install now, wait until the progress window disappears before opening the application again. The process normally takes a few minutes. If the window remains unchanged for more than fifteen minutes, record any error message and contact support. Do not repeatedly start the installer while another installation is still running.','如果现在安装，请等进度窗口消失后再重新打开应用。过程通常需要几分钟。如果窗口超过十五分钟都没有变化，请记录错误消息并联系支持。在另一次安装仍在运行时，不要反复启动安装程序。']
],[['ready to install','准备好安装','The update is ready to install.'],['current version','当前版本','Keep using the current version.'],['normally','通常','Installation normally takes a few minutes.'],['remain unchanged','保持不变','The window remains unchanged.'],['still running','仍在运行','Another installation is still running.']],[[
 '选择明天提醒会怎样？',['立即关闭应用','继续使用当前版本','删除下载的更新'],1,'第一段说 leave your current version running。'],['什么时候重新打开应用？',['一点击安装就打开','进度窗口消失后','必须等一天'],1,'wait until 限定了重新打开的时间。'],['安装窗口长时间不变化，首先应做什么？',['反复运行安装器','记录错误并联系支持','删除所有文档'],1,'第二段给出十五分钟这一条件和相应动作。']
],{task:'用英文告诉同事，你要推迟应用更新到明天，并说明安装前的准备。',audience:'同事',length:'4～6 句',requirements:['说明今天继续使用当前版本','说明明天安装前先保存文档','提醒不要同时运行多个安装程序'],starter:'I will install…\nBefore installing it, I will…',model:'I will install the update tomorrow. Choosing the reminder lets me keep using the current version today. It does not remove the downloaded update. Before installing it, I will save my open documents. I will also make sure that another installation is not already running.'});
U('replace-file',0,'Replace、Skip 和 Keep both','文件操作',[
 ['A file named report.txt already exists in this folder. Choose Replace to put the incoming file in its place. The existing file will no longer be available at this location. Choose Skip to leave the existing file unchanged and continue copying the remaining files. Skipping one file does not cancel the entire operation.','这个文件夹中已经有一个名为 report.txt 的文件。选择“替换”会用传入的文件取代它，原有文件将不再位于这个位置。选择“跳过”会保留原有文件不变，并继续复制其余文件。跳过一个文件不会取消整个操作。'],
 ['If you need both versions, choose Keep both. The incoming file will be saved with a different name. Before replacing an important file, compare its contents with the incoming version or make a separate backup. A newer date does not always mean that a file contains all the changes you want to keep.','如果两份都需要，请选择“保留两者”。传入的文件会以不同名称保存。在替换重要文件前，比较两份内容或单独备份。日期较新并不总意味着文件包含了所有你想保留的修改。']
],[['already exists','已经存在','A file with this name already exists.'],['in its place','代替它','Put the new file in its place.'],['remaining files','其余文件','Continue copying the remaining files.'],['keep both','保留两者','Choose Keep both to save both versions.'],['make a backup','制作备份','Make a backup before replacing the file.']],[[
 'Skip 会取消整个复制操作吗？',['会','不会，只跳过该文件','会删除其余文件'],1,'第一段最后一句明确否定取消整个操作。'],['需要两份文件时应选什么？',['Replace','Skip','Keep both'],2,'Keep both 保存两份，并修改传入文件的名称。'],['日期更新能保证包含所有需要的修改吗？',['不能','能','只有文件名相同时能'],0,'a newer date does not always mean 表示不能作这种保证。']
],{task:'解释你为什么没有直接替换文件，而是保留了两个版本。',audience:'共同编辑文档的同事',length:'4～6 句',requirements:['说明同名文件已经存在','说明保留两份的目的','说明接下来要比较内容'],starter:'A file named… already exists.\nI chose… because…',model:'A file named report.txt already exists in the folder. I chose Keep both because I am not sure which version contains all our changes. The incoming file now has a different name. I will compare the contents before replacing anything. A newer date alone is not enough to decide.'});
U('keyboard-shortcut',0,'快捷键为什么没反应','帮助说明',[
 ['Press Ctrl+K to open the command menu. Type part of a command name, then use the arrow keys to select a result. Press Enter to run the selected command, or press Escape to close the menu without making a change. You do not need to type the complete command name.','按 Ctrl+K 打开命令菜单。输入命令名的一部分，再用方向键选择结果。按 Enter 运行所选命令，或按 Escape 关闭菜单而不作更改。不必输入完整命令名。'],
 ['This shortcut only works when the application window is active. If you are typing in another application, it may do something different. Some keyboard layouts also use the same key combination for another purpose. If the shortcut does not work, open the Tools menu and choose Commands. You can then change the shortcut in Keyboard Settings.','这个快捷键只在应用窗口处于活动状态时生效。如果你正在另一个应用中打字，它可能执行不同操作。有些键盘布局也将同一组合键用于其他用途。如果快捷键无效，请打开“工具”菜单并选择“命令”，之后可在键盘设置中修改快捷键。']
],[['part of','……的一部分','Type part of the command name.'],['selected command','选中的命令','Run the selected command.'],['without making a change','不作更改','Close the menu without making a change.'],['active window','活动窗口','The shortcut works in the active window.'],['key combination','组合键','Choose a different key combination.']],[[
 '必须输入完整命令名吗？',['必须','不必','只能输入一个字母'],1,'第一段说 You do not need to type the complete command name。'],['Escape 在这个菜单里做什么？',['关闭菜单而不更改','执行所有命令','更换键盘布局'],0,'注意 or 连接两个不同动作。'],['快捷键无效时，可以用什么替代入口？',['关机按钮','Tools 菜单中的 Commands','其他应用的搜索框'],1,'第二段明确给出了菜单路径。']
],{task:'给不会用快捷键的朋友写一段操作说明。',audience:'初次使用该应用的朋友',length:'4～6 句',requirements:['说明如何打开命令菜单','说明怎样搜索和运行命令','提供快捷键失效时的替代方法'],starter:'First, make sure…\nThen press…',model:'First, make sure the application window is active. Press Ctrl+K to open the command menu. Type part of a command name and select a result with the arrow keys. Press Enter to run it. If the shortcut does not work, open Tools and choose Commands instead.'});
U('download-location',0,'下载完成后，文件在哪里','下载说明',[
 ['Your download has finished. To find the file, open the Downloads panel and select Show in folder next to its name. This opens the folder containing the file; it does not open the file itself. If you changed the download location earlier, the file may not be in your usual Downloads folder.','下载已完成。要找到文件，请打开下载面板，选择文件名旁的“在文件夹中显示”。这会打开文件所在的文件夹，而不是打开文件本身。如果之前更改过下载位置，文件可能不在平时的“下载”文件夹中。'],
 ['Removing an entry from the panel only clears the download record. It does not delete the saved file. To delete the file, use your file manager. If the file cannot be found, check whether it was moved or removed by another application. Download it again only after checking the address and confirming that it is the file you need.','从面板移除一项只会清除下载记录，不会删除保存的文件。要删除文件，请使用文件管理器。找不到文件时，请检查它是否被其他应用移动或移除。再次下载前，先检查地址并确认这是你需要的文件。']
],[['next to','在……旁边','Select the button next to the file name.'],['containing','包含……的','Open the folder containing the file.'],['download record','下载记录','Clear the download record.'],['file manager','文件管理器','Delete the file in your file manager.'],['confirm that','确认……','Confirm that the address is correct.']],[[
 'Show in folder 打开什么？',['文件本身','文件所在的文件夹','下载网站的主页'],1,'第一段特意对比 containing folder 和 file itself。'],['清除下载记录是否等于删除文件？',['等于','不等于','只会删除文本文件'],1,'第二段的 only 和 does not 区分了两件事。'],['再次下载前应确认什么？',['地址和文件是否正确','所有扩展都已删除','文件名至少十个字母'],0,'结尾要求先检查地址并确认文件符合需要。']
],{task:'向朋友解释，为什么清空下载面板后文件仍然存在。',audience:'朋友',length:'4～6 句',requirements:['区分下载记录和实际文件','说明如何定位文件','说明如何删除实际文件'],starter:'Clearing the panel only…\nTo find the file,…',model:'Clearing the Downloads panel only removes the download record. It does not delete the file saved on your device. To find the file, choose Show in folder before clearing the entry. This opens its location in your file manager. You can delete the actual file there if you no longer need it.'});
U('verification-link',0,'验证链接过期了','账户邮件',[
 ['Please verify your email address to finish creating your account. Open the link below within thirty minutes. The link can be used only once. If it has expired, return to the sign-in page and request a new message. Requesting another message will make the previous link invalid, even if thirty minutes have not yet passed.','请验证邮箱地址，完成账户创建。在三十分钟内打开下面的链接。链接只能使用一次。如果链接已过期，请返回登录页面申请新邮件。申请新邮件会使之前的链接失效，即使还没过三十分钟也是如此。'],
 ['If you did not create this account, you can ignore this message. Do not send your password or verification link to anyone who asks for it in a reply. Our support team does not need your password to help you. If you are unsure whether a message came from us, open the website directly rather than following a link in the message.','如果你没有创建这个账户，可以忽略邮件。不要把密码或验证链接发送给通过回复索要它们的人。支持团队帮助你时不需要你的密码。如果不确定邮件是否来自我们，请直接打开网站，而不是点击邮件中的链接。']
],[['verify','验证','Verify your email address.'],['within thirty minutes','在三十分钟内','Open the link within thirty minutes.'],['only once','仅一次','This link can be used only once.'],['previous link','先前的链接','The previous link is now invalid.'],['rather than','而不是','Open the site directly rather than following a link.']],[[
 '申请新邮件后，旧链接还没到三十分钟，能继续使用吗？',['能','不能','可以重复用三次'],1,'even if 引入不影响结论的条件：未满三十分钟也会失效。'],['不是你创建的账户，文中说可以怎样？',['回复密码','忽略邮件','把链接公开'],1,'第二段首句给出 ignore this message。'],['不确定邮件来源时，文章建议什么？',['直接打开网站','马上回复验证链接','下载邮件中的所有附件'],0,'最后一句建议直接访问网站。']
],{task:'写一条英文消息，解释为什么朋友收到的新验证链接能用，旧链接不能用。',audience:'正在注册账户的朋友',length:'4～6 句',requirements:['说明链接有时效且只能用一次','说明申请新邮件会使旧链接失效','提醒不要转发密码或验证链接'],starter:'Use the link in…\nThe older link…',model:'Use the link in the most recent email. Each link can be used only once and expires after thirty minutes. Requesting a new email makes the previous link invalid immediately. You do not need to keep trying the older link. Do not share your password or verification link with anyone.'});
U('password-reset',0,'重置密码不会自动退出所有设备','账户说明',[
 ['To reset your password, enter the email address associated with your account. If an account with that address exists, we will send reset instructions. For privacy reasons, this page will show the same confirmation message whether or not the address is registered. Receiving this confirmation does not prove that you have an account.','要重置密码，请输入与账户关联的邮箱。如果该地址对应的账户存在，我们会发送重置说明。出于隐私考虑，无论地址是否注册，这个页面都会显示相同确认消息。看到确认消息不代表你一定拥有账户。'],
 ['After choosing a new password, review the devices listed under Account Activity. In this practice service, changing your password does not automatically sign out every device. Select Sign out all other devices if you want to end those sessions. If no email arrives, check your spam folder and confirm that you entered the correct address before trying again.','选好新密码后，请查看“账户活动”中列出的设备。在本练习服务中，更改密码不会自动退出所有设备。如果想结束其他会话，请选择“退出所有其他设备”。如果没收到邮件，请检查垃圾邮件文件夹并确认地址输入正确，再重试。']
],[['associated with','与……关联','Use the address associated with your account.'],['whether or not','无论是否','The message appears whether or not the address is registered.'],['for privacy reasons','出于隐私考虑','We hide this information for privacy reasons.'],['sign out','退出登录','Sign out all other devices.'],['spam folder','垃圾邮件文件夹','Check your spam folder.']],[[
 '确认页面能证明邮箱已经注册吗？',['能','不能，两种情况显示相同消息','只能证明旧账户存在'],1,'whether or not 表示两种情况下都相同。'],['在文中这个服务里，改密码会退出所有设备吗？',['会','不会，要另外操作','会删除设备上的文件'],1,'第二段限定为本练习服务的行为，不是所有产品的通用规则。'],['没有邮件时，应先检查什么？',['垃圾邮件和输入地址','屏幕亮度','应用语言'],0,'结尾列出了再次尝试前的检查。']
],{task:'写信说明你看到重置确认，却还没有收到邮件，请求帮助。',audience:'账户支持人员',length:'4～6 句',requirements:['区分页面确认与实际收信','说明你已经检查的事项','不要提供密码'],starter:'I requested…\nThe page showed… but…',model:'I requested a password reset, and the page showed a confirmation message. However, I have not received the email. I checked my spam folder and confirmed that I entered the intended address. I understand that the confirmation does not prove the address is registered. Could you tell me what else I should check?' });
U('notification-settings',0,'关闭通知，还是关闭提醒声音','设置说明',[
 ['You can choose which notifications appear on your screen. Turn off Sound if you want to keep receiving messages without hearing an alert. Turn off Desktop notifications if you do not want message previews to appear outside the application. Neither setting stops new messages from arriving in your inbox.','你可以选择屏幕上显示哪些通知。如果想继续收消息但不听到提示音，请关闭“声音”。如果不想在应用外看到消息预览，请关闭“桌面通知”。这两个设置都不会阻止新消息进入收件箱。'],
 ['During a presentation, you may prefer to pause desktop notifications for one hour. They will resume automatically when the time ends. You can resume them earlier from the status menu. If important messages still need your attention, check your inbox during a break. A paused notification is not the same as a message that has been read.','演示期间，你可能希望暂停桌面通知一小时。时间结束后会自动恢复，也可以从状态菜单提前恢复。如果有重要消息需要处理，请在休息时查看收件箱。通知被暂停，不等于消息已经被阅读。']
],[['turn off','关闭','Turn off notification sounds.'],['message preview','消息预览','Hide message previews during a presentation.'],['neither','两者都不','Neither setting stops incoming messages.'],['resume automatically','自动恢复','Notifications will resume automatically.'],['during a break','休息期间','Check your inbox during a break.']],[[
 '只是不想听到提示音，应关闭什么？',['整个账户','Sound','收件箱'],1,'Sound 与 Desktop notifications 的作用不同。'],['关闭桌面通知后，消息还会进入收件箱吗？',['会','不会','只会进入垃圾邮件'],0,'Neither setting stops new messages from arriving。'],['暂停一小时后，通知如何恢复？',['只能重新安装','自动恢复，也可提前恢复','永远不会恢复'],1,'第二段说明 resume automatically，并提供提前恢复的入口。']
],{task:'告诉同事你演示时会暂停通知，但仍然会在休息时查看消息。',audience:'同事',length:'4～6 句',requirements:['说明暂停的是桌面通知','说明消息仍会收到','交代何时查看或恢复'],starter:'I am giving…\nI will pause…',model:'I am giving a presentation this afternoon, so I will pause desktop notifications for one hour. Your messages will still arrive in my inbox. I will check them during a break. Notifications will resume automatically after the hour ends. If the presentation finishes early, I can resume them from the status menu.'});
U('delivery-window',0,'预计送达，不是保证送达','订单邮件',[
 ['Your order has been dispatched. The estimated delivery date is Friday, but this is not a guaranteed appointment. The tracking page will show a narrower delivery window when the parcel reaches the local depot. If you will not be home, you can request delivery to a collection point before the driver starts the route.','你的订单已发出。预计送达日期是周五，但这不是保证的预约时间。包裹到达本地站点后，追踪页面会显示更小的送达时间范围。如果不在家，可以在司机出发派送前申请改送自提点。'],
 ['Changing the delivery location may add one working day. Please wait for confirmation before travelling to a collection point. The parcel may still be on its way even if the request appears in your account. Bring the collection code and a form of identification when you collect it. Someone else may collect it only if you have added their name in advance.','更改送达地点可能增加一个工作日。前往自提点之前请等待确认。即使账户中已经显示申请，包裹也可能仍在途中。取件时请携带取件码和身份证明。只有提前登记了他人的姓名，对方才可以代领。']
],[['estimated delivery date','预计送达日期','Friday is the estimated delivery date.'],['collection point','自提点','Choose a nearby collection point.'],['working day','工作日','The change may add one working day.'],['on its way','在途中','The parcel is still on its way.'],['in advance','提前','Add the collector’s name in advance.']],[[
 '周五一定能在某个固定时刻收到吗？',['一定','不一定，日期只是预计','必须上午九点收到'],1,'estimated 和 not guaranteed 限制了承诺程度。'],['看到改送申请就能马上去取吗？',['能','不能，要等确认','只有带电脑才能去'],1,'第二段要求先等 confirmation。'],['他人代领需要什么额外条件？',['提前登记代领人姓名','知道商品颜色即可','必须取消订单'],0,'only if 引出必要条件。']
],{task:'给朋友留言，请他代取包裹，并说明目前还在等待取件确认。',audience:'朋友',length:'4～6 句',requirements:['说明包裹尚未确认到达自提点','说明会提前登记代领人','提醒需要取件码和身份证明'],starter:'Could you collect…?\nPlease wait until…',model:'Could you collect my parcel for me? I have requested delivery to the collection point, but it has not been confirmed yet. Please wait until I send you the confirmation. I will add your name as the collector in advance. You will need the collection code and a form of identification.'});
U('appointment-change',0,'改约之前先确认新时间','预约邮件',[
 ['Your appointment is currently booked for Tuesday at 10:30 a.m. If you need a different time, use the Change appointment link below. Selecting a new time will temporarily hold it for five minutes. Your original appointment remains active until you confirm the replacement. Closing the page before confirmation will not change your booking.','你目前预约的是周二上午十点半。如果需要其他时间，请使用下面的“更改预约”链接。选择新时间后，会临时为你保留五分钟。在确认替代预约之前，原预约仍然有效。如果确认前关闭页面，预约不会改变。'],
 ['Once the new appointment is confirmed, we will send an updated email and release the original time. Please check the date and location carefully. Some afternoon appointments take place at a different office. If you cannot attend and do not need another time, choose Cancel appointment rather than leaving the booking unchanged.','新预约确认后，我们会发送更新邮件，并释放原时间。请仔细核对日期和地点，有些下午的预约在另一个办公室进行。如果无法出席且不需要其他时间，请选择“取消预约”，而不是让原预约保持不变。']
],[['currently booked','目前已预约','You are currently booked for Tuesday.'],['temporarily','临时地','The time is temporarily reserved.'],['remain active','仍然有效','Your original appointment remains active.'],['once confirmed','一经确认','Once confirmed, the new booking replaces the old one.'],['take place','举行；发生','The appointment takes place at another office.']],[[
 '只选新时间、未确认就关闭页面，会怎样？',['原预约不变','两次预约都取消','自动预约五次'],0,'原预约在确认替代时间之前仍有效。'],['什么时候释放原来的时间？',['打开邮件时','新预约确认后','五分钟之前'],1,'第二段 once 引出触发条件。'],['为什么要核对地点？',['有些下午预约在另一办公室','地点总是随机变化','网站不显示时间'],0,'文中有明确的地点例外。']
],{task:'用英文确认你的新预约，并询问下午的地点是否与原来一致。',audience:'预约接待人员',length:'4～6 句',requirements:['说明原预约时间','说明希望改到的新时间','明确询问地点，并请求确认'],starter:'My original appointment is…\nI would like to…',model:'My original appointment is on Tuesday at 10:30 a.m. I would like to move it to Thursday afternoon. Could you confirm whether the afternoon appointment takes place at the same office? I have not confirmed the replacement yet. Please let me know the correct location before I finish the change.'});
U('ask-for-help',0,'求助时，把卡在哪里说清楚','日常消息',[
 ['Hi Maya, I am trying to submit the application form, but the Submit button is disabled. I have filled in every field marked with an asterisk. The page says that one attachment is required, and I have uploaded a PDF. I can see its name below the upload area, but there is no confirmation mark next to it.','Maya，你好。我正在尝试提交申请表，但“提交”按钮不可用。我已经填写了所有带星号的字段。页面说需要一个附件，我已上传 PDF。上传区域下方能看到文件名，但旁边没有确认标记。'],
 ['Could you check whether the upload is complete? I have not refreshed the page because I do not want to lose the information I entered. If you need a screenshot, I can send one with my personal details covered. I can wait until this afternoon, so there is no need to interrupt your current task.','能否帮我看看上传是否完成？我还没刷新页面，因为不想丢失已填写的信息。如果需要截图，我可以发送一张遮住个人信息的。等到今天下午也可以，所以不必打断你手头的任务。']
],[['disabled','不可用的；被禁用的','The Submit button is disabled.'],['marked with','标有……的','Fill in fields marked with an asterisk.'],['attachment','附件','One attachment is required.'],['personal details','个人信息','Cover your personal details in the screenshot.'],['there is no need to','没有必要……','There is no need to interrupt your task.']],[[
 '作者已经做过什么？',['刷新页面十次','填写必填项并上传 PDF','删除申请表'],1,'第一段列出已尝试的步骤。'],['作者为什么没刷新？',['怕丢失已输入信息','不知道刷新键在哪里','因为文件太小'],0,'because 后给出原因。'],['对方必须立即中断工作吗？',['必须','不必，下午之前可以等','必须取消所有会议'],1,'最后一句明确降低紧急程度。']
],{task:'写一条具体求助消息，说明你无法提交一个表单。',audience:'同事或客服',length:'5～7 句',requirements:['写清目标和卡住的地方','说明已尝试的操作','说明可以提供的信息和紧急程度'],starter:'I am trying to… but…\nI have already…',model:'I am trying to submit the form, but the Submit button is disabled. I have completed the required fields and uploaded a PDF. The file name appears, but I cannot see a confirmation mark. I have not refreshed the page because I might lose my answers. Could you check whether the upload is complete? I can send a screenshot with personal details covered. This can wait until this afternoon.'});
U('return-request',0,'退款、换货和退货条件','购物邮件',[
 ['Thank you for contacting us about the damaged lamp. We can offer a replacement or a refund. If you choose a replacement, we will send a new lamp after the damaged one reaches our returns centre. If you prefer a refund, the amount will go back to your original payment method after the return has been checked.','感谢你就损坏的灯联系我们。我们可以提供换货或退款。如果选择换货，我们会在损坏的灯到达退货中心后寄出新灯。如果选择退款，在退货检查完成后，款项会原路退回。'],
 ['Please keep the packaging until we send the return label. You do not need to pay for return postage in this case. Attach the label to the outside of the parcel and remove any old delivery labels. Let us know which option you prefer. We cannot arrange both a replacement and a refund for the same item.','在我们发送退货标签前，请保留包装。在这种情况下，你不需要支付退货邮费。将标签贴在包裹外面，并移除旧的配送标签。请告诉我们你更倾向哪种处理。对于同一件物品，我们不能同时安排换货和退款。']
],[['replacement','替换品；换货','I would prefer a replacement.'],['refund','退款','The refund goes to the original payment method.'],['return label','退货标签','Attach the return label to the parcel.'],['postage','邮费','You do not need to pay return postage.'],['in this case','在这种情况下','Return postage is free in this case.']],[[
 '新灯何时寄出？',['一打开邮件就寄','损坏的灯到达退货中心后','退款完成后必须再买'],1,'after 引出换货的前提。'],['本案例中谁需要支付退货邮费？',['买家必须支付','买家不必支付','只有选择退款才免邮'],1,'in this case 限定了免邮适用的案例，文中未区分退款或换货。'],['可以同时获得同一物品的换货和退款吗？',['不可以','可以','只要移除标签就可以'],0,'最后一句明确禁止同时安排两者。']
],{task:'回复客服，选择退款并询问下一步如何退货。',audience:'商家客服',length:'4～6 句',requirements:['明确选择退款而非换货','说明包装已保留','询问退货标签及退款流程'],starter:'Thank you for…\nI would prefer…',model:'Thank you for explaining the options. I would prefer a refund rather than a replacement. I have kept the damaged lamp and its packaging. Please send me the return label and let me know where to take the parcel. I understand that the return must be checked before the refund is issued.'});
